Spec: Declaration review transaction verification

Purpose:
  Verify host decisions and application isolation using owned temporary SQLite state and real pipe requests.

Owns:
  ./ReviewTests.cs

Must:
  Remove newer connection journals when constructing older schema fixtures; migration must not invent flows or attachments.
  Remove newer access tables when constructing historical schema fixtures and verify the current schema version after migration.
  Cover approval, denial, revocation, restart, old operation replay, stale snapshots, ABA declaration changes and cross-store rejection.
  Verify atomic schema-one migration preserves pending operations without inventing approved state.
  Exercise concurrent decisions, quota exhaustion, injected transaction failure and corrupt rows without partial changes.
  Verify ordinary application requests cannot invoke review or retrieve administrator operations.
